diff --git a/CHANGES.rst b/CHANGES.rst
index a39471f9..df866629 100644
--- a/CHANGES.rst
+++ b/CHANGES.rst
@@ -17,6 +17,9 @@ Unreleased
 -   ``echo_via_pager`` flushes after each write, so passing a generator streams
     output to the pager incrementally instead of staying hidden until the pipe
     buffer fills. :issue:`3242` :issue:`2542` :pr:`3534`
+-   Fix ``echo_via_pager`` closing the standard output stream when the pager
+    command cannot be found, which raised ``ValueError: I/O operation on closed
+    file`` in :class:`~testing.CliRunner`.
 
 
 Version 8.4.1
